      "quote": "we examined the evidence on transjugular intrahepatic portosystemic shunt (TIPS) as a bridge to elective and emergency surgery in cirrhotic patients. Methods MEDLINE and Scopus were searched for studies reporting the outcomes of cirrhotic patients undergoing elective and emergency surgery with preoperative TIPS.",
      "reason": "A comparison direction is suggested (preoperative TIPS in the included studies), but the planned comparisons are not stated using a clear PICO (or equivalent) structure. No explicit, full planned comparison (e.g., intervention vs specific comparator group and targeted outcomes) is presented in the retrieved text in PICO form."
